simple react state management library without a provider. Use the hooks inside your components to create a store. You can create as many store as you want, they will work independently from each other. Just call the set function to update the store, async functions don't matter.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/6dce934174fcb14c79fa332a449fe8fe","num_upvotes":12,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-02-19T06:45:22.000Z"},{"id":"b8XYk8xdu","title":"A simple Vite, SolidJS, Electron integration template","url":"https://reactjsexample.com/a-simple-vite-solidjs-electron-integration-template/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/a-simple-vite-solidjs-electron-integration-template-b8xyk8xdu","summary":"vite-solid-electron is a very simple Vite, SolidJS, Electron integration template. It contains only the basic dependencies. The extension is very flexible and can be used with SerialPort, SQLite3, or other node-native addons in the Main-process.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/11d12cd8f6c8fbfcb7d5463164d782a8","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2022-02-19T05:46:37.000Z"},{"id":"wkE84ruvS","title":"Patika React E-Commerce App with Mehmet Seven","url":"https://reactjsexample.com/patika-react-e-commerce-app-with-mehmet-seven/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/patika-react-e-commerce-app-with-mehmet-seven-wke84ruvs","summary":null,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/cd8458212ff15a52f4cfb2eace35c8a2","num_upvotes":5,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-02-19T05:46:37.000Z"},{"id":"NgHQe05k8","title":"Create unique keys for map elements that don't have unique property","url":"https://reactjsexample.com/create-unique-keys-for-map-elements-that-dont-have-unique-property/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/create-unique-keys-for-map-elements-that-don-t-have-unique-property-nghqe05k8","summary":"Small helper library to generate unique keys for map in react when you don't have unique property. Works with any type of data - arrays, objects, strings, numbers... Use getUniqueKey to create a unique key for your map. Use useGetUniqueKey ( ) to generate a key for a map.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/6a35a83fbdf9960457c55e5f14bb19f5","num_upvotes":6,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-02-19T05:46:37.000Z"},{"id":"l904b2uuF","title":"The app with authentication and ability to create different type of games","url":"https://reactjsexample.com/the-app-with-authentication-and-ability-to-create-different-type-of-games/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-app-with-authentication-and-ability-to-create-different-type-of-games-l904b2uuf","summary":null,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/5f011482d0eabf070f5d2b08130bb7ed","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-02-19T05:46:37.000Z"},{"id":"WTL-owuJN","title":"A customizable Next.js and Tailwind blog starter","url":"https://reactjsexample.com/a-customizable-next-js-and-tailwind-blog-starter/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/a-customizable-next-js-and-tailwind-blog-starter-wtl-owujn","summary":"A customizable blog starter using Next.js v12 and Tailwind v3.0. Built-in MDX v1 support. Includes modern design with dark & light themes. You can get started with this project in two ways: locally or using the setup wizard. Click here to watch the template walkthrough!","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/8970d1f68a06282a7b0fea0b2603f525","num_upvotes":10,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-02-19T05:46:37.000Z"},{"id":"xZTItA0ZM","title":"Wordle XD: A Worlde Game made using ReactJS and Tailwind CSS","url":"https://reactjsexample.com/wordle-xd-a-worlde-game-made-using-reactjs-and-tailwind-css/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/wordle-xd-a-worlde-game-made-using-reactjs-and-tailwind-css-xztita0zm","summary":"This project was bootstrapped with Create React App. I made Wordle using ReactJS. I didn\u2019t write a single line of CSS (Actually I wrote 3 but you didn't see anything).View Demo View Github Github.Getting Started with Createreact.com.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/a51c0a1589bde9eda444d5ed8e038164","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-02-19T05:46:37.000Z"},{"id":"RGfsAkuHz","title":"ERC-1155 Token Minter built with React + Moralis + Truffle","url":"https://reactjsexample.com/erc-1155-token-minter-built-with-react-moralis-truffle/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/erc-1155-token-minter-built-with-react-moralis-truffle-rgfsakuhz","summary":"Mintango is a fun and simple dapp that allows you to mint custom ERC-1155 NFTs. Once you have minted your new token you can check them out in the \u201cMy Goods\u201d section of the dapp. Backlisting Ethereum accounts to prevent them from minting and voting. Whitelisting accounts to exempt them from paying the minting fee.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/4cc2cc888b0cd06645b148242fcc3736","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-02-19T05:46:37.000Z"},{"id":"2VbPcQRZ3","title":"Drag and drop Argo Workflows tool With React.js","url":"https://reactjsexample.com/drag-and-drop-argo-workflows-tool-with-react-js/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/drag-and-drop-argo-workflows-tool-with-react-js-2vbpcqrz3","summary":"Workflows can power CI/CD pipelines, batch data processing, and third-party app integrations. Depending on the devops support team to provide container images and scripts to be used in execution steps. This project is fresh and a WIP, with no stable releases yet.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/6061122aba9339a044958c6a23397540","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-02-18T07:16:43.000Z"},{"id":"CbNkMH0g_","title":"A ready-to-go with a well-thought-out structure Electron app boilerplate with ReactJS, TypeScript","url":"https://reactjsexample.com/a-ready-to-go-with-a-well-thought-out-structure-electron-app-boilerplate-with-reactjs-typescript/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/a-ready-to-go-with-a-well-thought-out-structure-electron-app-boilerplate-with-reactjs-typescript-cbnkmh0g","summary":"The Electron app boilerplate includes ReactJS, TypeScript, CSS / SASS modules, SWC, Eslint, Prettier and more. The compiled apps will be available on the dist folder. There\u2019s a bunch of ways you can contribute to this project, like by: Reporting a bug or recommending it to your friends.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/9d4db8d65634f4b10364b63bef9a7d1a","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-02-18T07:16:43.000Z"}],"top_posts":[{"id":"rJRwc-Mi0","title":"A personal portfolio website of theme Ubuntu 20.04, made using React.js & tailwind CSS","url":"https://reactjsexample.com/a-personal-portfolio-website-of-theme-ubuntu-20-04-made-using-react-js-tailwind-css/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/a-personal-portfolio-website-of-theme-ubuntu-20-04-made-using-react-js-tailwind-css-rjrwc-mi0","summary":"This is a personal portfolio website of theme Ubuntu 20.04, made using React.js & tailwind CSS. Create a new service, select and log in to your newly created outlook or gmail account on EmailJS. Any contributiors who wants to make this website better can make contribution,which will be greatly appreciated.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/0dfed0904b0fc721aac7840ea20f8b9f","num_upvotes":165,"num_comments":19,"created_at":"2022-02-04T10:22:56.000Z"},{"id":"VPPHYy0W7","title":"Fullstack Next.js E-Commerce made with NextAuth + Prisma, Docker + TypeScript + React Query + Stripe + Tailwind Sentry","url":"https://reactjsexample.com/fullstack-next-js-e-commerce-made-with-nextauth-prisma-docker-typescript-react-query-stripe-tailwind-sentry/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/fullstack-next-js-e-commerce-made-with-nextauth-prisma-docker-typescript-react-query-stripe-vpphyy0w7","summary":"Fullstack Next.js E-Commerce made with NextAuth + Prisma, Docker + TypeScript + React Query + Stripe + Tailwind Sentry. Open issues, bugs, and feature requests are all listed on the issues tab and labeled accordingly. Feel free to open bug tickets and make feature requests.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/6ac08d15c92168744ca2600f9222f9b0","num_upvotes":123,"num_comments":4,"created_at":"2021-11-29T16:28:00.000Z"},{"id":"0yHFV_Tw1","title":"A ready to use React hook library written in Typescript","url":"https://reactjsexample.com/a-ready-to-use-react-hook-library-written-in-typescript/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/a-ready-to-use-react-hook-library-written-in-typescript-0yhfv-tw1","summary":"React hook library, ready to use, written in Typescript. usehooks.ts is a Gatsby powered blog hosted with Github & netlify that publishes easy to understand React Hook code snippets. If you'd like to submit new post ideas, improve existing posts, or change anything about the website feel free to submit an issue or pull-request.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/ece5c7f33cf77a224526ce38c8c14233","num_upvotes":115,"num_comments":3,"created_at":"2021-09-13T14:12:42.000Z"},{"id":"e-eMkZnys","title":"Sha256 Algorithm Explained With React.js","url":"https://reactjsexample.com/sha256-algorithm-explained-with-react-js/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sha256-algorithm-explained-with-react-js-e-emkznys","summary":"Sha256 algorithm explained online step by step visually. I hope this will be helpful for students learning about hash functions and sha256. The code it\u2019s quite messy and probably there are some parts that don\u2019t follow the react way. Ask me anything at @manc